passed; truthful dry-run verified; canonical Talaris vault commit 607bdd922e8935e9d1b3a163b620c850de6e8201 pushed. Ringer executable was not present, so no Ringer receipt was fabricated.\n\nCORRECTION: Exact callback provenance is Claude SDK session b4770d6c-7f90-458f-8725-3e0bfa7fce03 (claude-sonnet-4-6), implementing hermes-krh. Globally enabled Cloudflare MCP startup discovery caused the prompt; the task never called a Cloudflare tool. Fable session 98b92750-e154-4aef-b444-f45c603171f2 likely created client registration. No token file, no granted account, dead callbac","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"critical","assigneeAgentId":null,"assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":null,"createdByUserId":"local-board","responsibleUserId":"local-board","issueNumber":3300,"identifier":"JAC-3300","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":"2026-07-11T18:37:29.491Z","completedAt":"2026-07-11T18:41:29.032Z","cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-11T18:06:50.354Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-11T18:42:25.912Z","labels":[{"id":"adfe43f8-aa65-4e48-b659-97226e54ed6a","companyId":"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7","name":"beads:hermes-4i2","color":"#4caf50","createdAt":"2026-07-11T18:26:01.176Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-11T18:26:01.176Z"}],"labelIds":["adfe43f8-aa65-4e48-b659-97226e54ed6a"],"watchdog":null,"activeRun":null,"lastActivityAt":"2026-07-11T18:42:25.924Z","blockerAttention":{"state":"none","reason":null,"unresolvedBlockerCount":0,"coveredBlockerCount":0,"stalledBlockerCount":0,"attentionBlockerCount":0,"sampleBlockerIdentifier":null,"sampleStalledBlockerIdentifier":null},"successfulRunHandoff":null,"activeRecoveryAction":null},{"id":"99f48ece-2c3a-4b67-b83c-b486288270a8","companyId":"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7","projectId":null,"projectWorkspaceId":null,"goalId":null,"parentId":null,"title":"Ringer Pattern: Failure Recovery + Sync Protocol — How do we not fall off when a task fails?","description":"The Ringer Pattern plan at /tmp/hermes-6ax-ringer-pattern-plan.md covers check gates, retry loops, and eval logs. But there's a critical gap: what happens when a task FAILS and we need to stay in sync across the fleet?\n\nContext:\n- We run 11 agents in Paperclip + Hermes subagents + Beads queue\n- When a task fails (check gate exit non-zero, agent errors, timeout), we need:\n  1. The failure to be visible to the orchestrator (not silently swallowed)\n  2. State to stay synced — failed task shouldn't leave artifacts half-written or issues half-assigned\n  3. Memory planes (OB1, Hindsight, Holographic, Honcho) to capture the failure so future runs learn from it\n  4. The retry to feed exact failure output back (Ringer does this) but also sync the fleet state\n\nQuestions to answer:\n1. What does the failure recovery loop look like? (check fails → what happens next?)\n2. How do we prevent silent desync — where an agent errors but the issue stays 'in_progress' forever?\n3. How
 should failed check gate output flow into memory planes?\n4. What's the protocol when a worker dies mid-task (process crash, timeout, OOM)?\n5. How does this integrate with our existing Paperclip error states and Beads queue?\n","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"critical","assigneeAgentId":"f1ef5e14-d8d4-4030-9e37-7b4fc764ce3d","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":null,"createdByUserId":"local-board","responsibleUserId":"local-board","issueNumber":3276,"identifier":"JAC-3276","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":"2026-07-09T00:59:06.983Z","completedAt":"2026-07-09T00:59:38.297Z","cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-09T00:56:46.955Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-09T00:59:38.307Z","labels":[],"labelIds":[],"watchdog":null,"activeRun":null,"lastActivityAt":"2026-07-09T00:59:38.314Z","blockerAttention":{"state":"none","reason":null,"unresolvedBlockerCount":0,"coveredBlockerCount":0,"stalledBlockerCount":0,"attentionBlockerCount":0,"sampleBlockerIdentifier":null,"sampleStalledBlockerIdentifier":null},"successfulRunHandoff":null,"activeRecoveryAction":null},{"id":"b04f3306-05ea-4750-9af7-9a8a4fa9f83d","companyId":"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7","projectId":null,"projectWorkspaceId":null,"goalId":null,"parentId":null,"title":"EXECUTE: Read each P1 Bead and produce extraction artifact","description":"You have 5 P1 Beads assigned in the Beads queue at ~/bin/bd. For each bead:\n1. Run: ~/bin/bd show <bead-id> to read the full description\n2. Research the topic using available tools (web_search, grep, fact_store)\n3. Write the extraction artifact to /tmp/<bead-id>-extraction.md\n4. Run: ~/bin/bd update <bead-id> --status in_progress\n5. After all 5 are done, run: ~/bin/bd close <bead-id> for each\n\nBeads to execute:\n- hermes-3jk: Fable 5 Extraction: Recorder Skill\n- hermes-92b: Fable 5 Extraction: Consultant Audit\n- hermes-d07: Fable 5 Extraction: Second Brain Run\n- hermes-qtk: Fable 5 Extraction: Goals + Dynamic Workflows\n- hermes-w7r: Fable 5 Extraction: Plant Standards in Workspace\n- hermes-ryo: Fable 5 Prompt Audit: Strip Small-Model Scaffolding\n- hermes-00f: Multi-Model Review: Fable Extraction Post\n\nAlso execute the 3 Adopt pattern beads:\n- hermes-6ax: Adopt Ringer Pattern\n- hermes-6ee: Adopt Constitution Pattern\n- hermes-mg3: Adopt Org Chart Pattern\n\nDo ALL of these. Write real artifacts. Close each bead when done.","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"critical","assigneeAgentId":"f1ef5e14-d8d4-4030-9e37-7b4fc764ce3d","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":null,"createdByUserId":"local-board","responsibleUserId":"local-board","issueNumber":3274,"identifier":"JAC-3274","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":"2026-07-09T00:52:57.773Z","completedAt":"2026-07-09T00:53:56.456Z","cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-09T00:43:10.667Z","updatedAt":"