 credential changes, no destructive ops, no external egress, no external messages. Loopback probes only. Completion re-wakes coordinator parent JAC-4318.","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"2c6b1cc9-aad2-431b-93ea-e31f0612be65","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","createdByUserId":null,"responsibleUserId":null,"issueNumber":4368,"identifier":"JAC-4368","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":"2026-08-01T15:48:28.495Z","completedAt":"2026-08-01T15:59:25.671Z","cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-01T15:48:28.439Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T15:59:25.726Z","labels":[],"labelIds":[],"watchdog":null,"activeRun":null,"lastActivityAt":"2026-08-01T15:59:25.748Z","blockerAttention":{"state":"none","reason":null,"unresolvedBlockerCount":0,"coveredBlockerCount":0,"stalledBlockerCount":0,"attentionBlockerCount":0,"sampleBlockerIdentifier":null,"sampleStalledBlockerIdentifier":null},"successfulRunHandoff":null,"activeRecoveryAction":null},{"id":"e2d3dd85-72ed-435b-ae92-f17623bea5c3","companyId":"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7","projectId":null,"projectWorkspaceId":null,"goalId":"6eace62f-8d6f-4543-b419-75d98c7da6e9","parentId":"b787a126-7d28-44ff-93ca-30a6b3f8efe1","title":"JAC-4318 dispatch: Fix reverse_sync advancing tracked status on failed PATCH (bead hermes-hpux)","description":"Coordinator dispatch (lane: claude-code / omnigent, Herald). Independent, well-scoped correctness bug with existing test.\n\n**Bead:** hermes-hpux [BUG] — reverse_sync advances tracked status on failed Paperclip PATCH (drops mirror on transient outage). Surfaced by JAC-3487.4 E2E test `test_reverse_sync_records_status_even_when_patch_fails`.\n\n**Problem:** in `sync_adapter.reverse_sync_beads_to_paperclip`, `synced_bead_statuses[bead_id]` is written **unconditionally** — even when `pc_patch` returns None (HTTP 500) or there is no `linked_issue_id`. A transient Paperclip outage then permanently drops that status mirror because the next cycle sees it as already-synced.\n\n**Fix:** only advance tracked status after a **confirmed successful** mirror. Additive test coverage already exists — flip the characterization test to assert non-advancement once fixed.\n\n**Deliverable:** the fix (diff/path) + the test flipped to assert non-advancement, passing. Note on hermes-hpux.\n\n**Constraints:** correctness fix only — no credential changes, no destructive ops, no external messages. Evidence = diff + test run output. Completion re-wakes coordinator parent JAC-4318.","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"a1e8cb0d-9132-4b3b-b7a3-8b53cdb10708","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","createdByUserId":null,"responsibleUserId":null,"issueNumber":4369,"identifier":"JAC-4369","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust