ervice + probe evidence. Note on hermes-9ill.6.\n\n**Constraints:** define/verify only — do NOT open new external egress, rotate credentials, weaken an auth ","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"a1e8cb0d-9132-4b3b-b7a3-8b53cdb10708","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","createdByUserId":null,"responsibleUserId":null,"issueNumber":4366,"identifier":"JAC-4366","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":"2026-08-01T15:42:45.619Z","completedAt":"2026-08-01T15:47:08.924Z","cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-01T15:42:45.558Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T15:47:08.955Z","labels":[],"labelIds":[],"watchdog":null,"activeRun":null,"lastActivityAt":"2026-08-01T15:47:08.986Z","blockerAttention":{"state":"none","reason":null,"unresolvedBlockerCount":0,"coveredBlockerCount":0,"stalledBlockerCount":0,"attentionBlockerCount":0,"sampleBlockerIdentifier":null,"sampleStalledBlockerIdentifier":null},"successfulRunHandoff":null,"activeRecoveryAction":null},{"id":"873af15f-6f8a-456f-be45-bb3e1b6c28e4","companyId":"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7","projectId":null,"projectWorkspaceId":null,"goalId":"6eace62f-8d6f-4543-b419-75d98c7da6e9","parentId":"b787a126-7d28-44ff-93ca-30a6b3f8efe1","title":"JAC-4318 dispatch: Beads split-brain incident-playbook doc (bead hermes-7bjg)","description":"Coordinator dispatch (lane: claude-code / omnigent, Plan Runner). Independent, additive documentation — zero mutation risk.\n\n**Bead:** hermes-7bjg — Beads split-brain incident-playbook doc (recovery runbook). Carved from hermes-684p after the dashboard+alerting slice shipped (JAC-4359, done); ref hermes-5fv4.\n\n**Scope:** write the incident-playbook / recovery runbook for Beads cross-host split-brain / server-unreachable. Document:\n1. **Detection** — the dashboard CRITICAL states (built in JAC-4359).\n2. **Safe reconcile steps** — explicitly NO force-push; export-both-heads + diff; human sign-off before any convergence.\n3. **Escalation / human sign-off** gate.\n\nThe dashboard already surfaces the CRITICAL states and the gated alert actions carry runbook stubs — expand those stubs into the full runbook. Land the doc in the appropriate repo/vault docs location and link it from the alert stubs.\n\n**Deliverable:** the runbook doc (path) + note on hermes-7bjg. Evidence = file path + a short excerpt.\n\n**Constraints:** documentation only — no force-push, no live reconcile, no credential changes, no external messages. Completion re-wakes coordinator parent JAC-4318.","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"2c6b1cc9-aad2-431b-93ea-e31f0612be65","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","createdByUserId":null,"responsibleUserId":null,"issueNumber":4365,"identifier":"JAC-4365","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":