- Meets the plan's 9 V1 acceptance criteria: contract-bound, six views, trust-tiering visible everywhere, working agent→session→run→replay drill-down, privacy honored, completion-first (no auto-intervention), graceful degradation, spend reconciliation, and signed-off design artifacts.\n\n### Blocked by\n- [JAC-4186](/JAC/issues/JAC-4186) (D2 — trust-tier components)\n- [JAC-4187](/JAC/issues/JAC-4187) (D3 — wireframes)\n- [JAC-4185](/JAC/issues/JAC-4185) (D4 — mock dataset)\n- **Governance:** the [JAC-3929](/JAC/issues/JAC-3929) approval gate governs starting this build slice — do not begin implementation until that gate authorizes execution.\n\n### Notes\n- Prefer existing fleet infra (Paperclip API, Bifrost, Herdr, Ringer receipts). Read path only; no provider calls, no collectors, no account/confi","status":"todo","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"2c6b1cc9-aad2-431b-93ea-e31f0612be65","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","createdByUserId":null,"responsibleUserId":null,"issueNumber":4190,"identifier":"JAC-4190","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":null,"completedAt":null,"cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-31T19:51:46.566Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T11:35:46.793Z","labels":[],"labelIds":[],"watchdog":null,"activeRun":null,"lastActivityAt":"2026-08-01T11:35:46.798Z","blockerAttention":{"state":"none","reason":null,"unresolvedBlockerCount":0,"coveredBlockerCount":0,"stalledBlockerCount":0,"attentionBlockerCount":0,"sampleBlockerIdentifier":null,"sampleStalledBlockerIdentifier":null},"successfulRunHandoff":null,"activeRecoveryAction":null},{"id":"ca0e0376-b961-4db0-8180-1116e7fdb7ef","companyId":"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7","projectId":"469ccf2a-9b0c-48a0-a263-0f4e48403224","projectWorkspaceId":"abf4c25f-d3ed-4083-bf8b-2b7106cd6245","goalId":null,"parentId":"d04c343c-3d0d-4bef-81b8-c612eec8cc4b","title":"Ringer shared active-work dispatch — Aegis runner / Talaris observer","description":"## Purpose\n\nRegister a reusable, low-cost Ringer run that snapshots the current active Paperclip portfolio and verifies the shared Aegis/Talaris operating contract. This is a coordination and execution-evidence record only; it does not modify Beads, lifecycle status, goal mappings, Family Bulletin data, credentials, or system configuration.\n\n## Run contract\n\n- **Authority:** Aegis executes and stores Ringer receipts.\n- **Shared coordination:** Paperclip stores the durable run pointer, results, commands, and artifact references visible from either machine.\n- **Replica:** Talaris can read the same Paperclip entry and trigger the Aegis-hosted run over SSH; it does not write authoritative work state.\n- **Cost lane:** deterministic mock worker plus Python verification; zero model tokens.\n- **Stop conditions:** no deletes, force-pushes, Beads writes, goal remaps, credential changes, service changes, or authoritative configuration writes.\n\n## Trigger commands\n\nFrom Aegis:\n`RINGER_NO_CATALOG_REFRESH=1 /Users/hermes/.local/bin/ringer run /Users/hermes/ringer/manifests/fleet-active-work-dispatch.ringer.json --identity hermes-ringer --no-dashboard`\n\nFrom Talaris:\n`ssh aegis 'RINGER_NO_CATALOG","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"a1e8cb0d-9132-4b3b-b7a3-8b53cdb10708","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"ex