irmed public egress + tailnet login to Aegis). It also false-positives on purely-local ops whose text merely contains network-ish tokens.\n\n**Fix direction:** enforce at the process-tree or network layer — per-session network namespace / firewall egress allowlist / seccomp / a real sandbox runtime — not command-string keyword matching. Until landed, treat OpenClaw sandbox labeling as advisory.\n\n**Deliverable (defensive only):** design + implement a real containment mechanism, or if full enforcement is out of scope this cycle, land a concrete first increment (e.g. egress allowlist) plus a written gap analysis. Evidence = diff/path + a demonstration that the prior indirection bypass is now contained (and local false-positives reduced). Lea","status":"done","workMode":"standard","harnessKind":null,"priority":"high","assigneeAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","assigneeUserId":null,"checkoutRunId":null,"executionRunId":null,"executionAgentNameKey":null,"executionLockedAt":null,"createdByAgentId":"dc2ca597-dd20-4a73-9fd3-8bef3da92ea9","createdByUserId":null,"responsibleUserId":"local-board","issueNumber":4325,"identifier":"JAC-4325","originKind":"manual","originId":null,"originRunId":null,"originFingerprint":"default","requestDepth":0,"billingCode":null,"assigneeAdapterOverrides":null,"executionPolicy":null,"executionState":null,"monitorNextCheckAt":null,"monitorWakeRequestedAt":null,"monitorLastTriggeredAt":null,"monitorAttemptCount":0,"monitorNotes":null,"monitorScheduledBy":null,"executionWorkspaceId":null,"executionWorkspacePreference":null,"executionWorkspaceSettings":null,"sourceTrust":null,"startedAt":"2026-08-01T05:56:50.781Z","completedAt":"2026-08-01T06:41:36.712Z","cancelledAt":null,"hiddenAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-01T05:56:50.336Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T06:41:36.731Z","labels":[],"labelIds":[],"watchdog":null,"activeRun":null,"lastActivityAt":"2026-08-01T06:41:36.751Z","blockerAttention":{"state":"none","reason":null,"unresolvedBlockerCou