        "name": "Health",
        "description": "## Purpose\nPrivate family health coordination lane for wellness, care logistics, rehabilitation, and long-term wellbeing. Use it to organize wellness and care logistics while keeping sensitive records in their approved protected systems.\n\n## Scope\n- Fitness, nutrition, and wellness planning\n- Appointment, follow-up, and care-coordination tasks\n- Pointers to authoritative records and practitioner guidance\n- Automation that reduces administrative burden without impersonating clinical judgment\n\n## Boundaries\n- Paperclip stores work state and minimal coordination context, not a medical record\n- No diagnosis, prescribing, or emergency substitution\n- Sensitive source documents remain in approved protected stores; link by reference rather than copying when possible\n\n## Current state\nThe project is an active coordination container with no verified dedicated code repository. Do not create a workspace until a canonical substrate is established.\n\n## Connections\n- [Agentic OS](/projects/f99704da-43b5-4cf7-89ef-13f59a348d90) \u2014 automation, runtime, and governance standards\n- [Onboarding](/projects/60bf492f-74ce-4084-83c9-d80c5f8bfaa9) \u2014 safe integration and access checks\n- Accessible through the registered Paperclip MCP server; cross-project URLs are pointers, not semantic relationships.\n\n**Stable project ID:** `24790c7e-0ab5-403c-89da-e13b0a460ea7`",
